OL,3,AUS envoys set for Ukraine talks after
OL,4,Ameeting Putin in Russia
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt will be to the first trip by US
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump's top
OL,8,Fnegotiators to Ukraine's capital. Putin
OL,9,Fand Ukrainian President Volodymyr
OL,10,FZelensky have agreed to halt strikes on
OL,11,Feach other's capitals for three days.
